=00_AfunHdkfpcdtOGAwyzyK1ipOAlu56rSPIPeqTJCrbX5kKA&oe=699AE91E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "247096786454689", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162682_132381304133910_8499134903143628800_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VNuxflMG7GUQ7kNvwGY4Vex&_nc_oc=AdmWJf9oYdc08PAIYYoWe3WBRe-weAiWNvzSgf8uXjdNuHTMjNoXKiSS6pq-EbAoSlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvZiwRxN6BcR2L4IVZ_pNeKBvo9GJ6rLn8jzw-Ij9WYwA&oe=699AE1A2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "coco_video_7.png", "id": "138276410159384", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162696_138276413492717_1494748721810767872_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c6iGo--Wp2YQ7kNvwGXJ_8L&_nc_oc=AdkF4BryunRDeF1RBhr2AL1G4yZLE6SP-3ldcEgEVB6q1Cqo5LKjvgDuOKIwCLqt3uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftBxssJjwc0EwUsdn_Kopc9Qumf0m4-tPx8gtvsT5mz8w&oe=699B0DED"}, "display_name": "Coco VR", "keywords": ["Coco", "VR", "Disney", "Pixar", "Oculus"], "long_description": "Coco VR is Pixar\u2019s stunning debut into virtual reality: an adventure into the beautiful Disney-Pixar film, Coco, coming to theaters November 22.  \n\nFollow the magical alebrije into the luminous world of Coco filled with lovable characters and beautiful settings from the film.\n\nFEATURES\n* Meet Miguel, Ceci, and Hector in fascinating locations featured in the movie.\n* Express your uniqueness and rock a new style in Ceci\u2019s costume shop.\n* Take a gondola ride and see the gorgeous city from above.\n* Live a little in the spotlight!  You\u2019re the star alongside of Hector in a musical celebration of Dia de los Muertos!", "short_description": "Introducing Pixar Animation Studios\u2019 first VR experience with the visual - and storytelling - magic only Pixar could produce. You and your friends will explore the world of Disney\u2022Pixar's newest film, Coco, in this social VR experience."}]}, "develop